%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Cutscenes_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b3eec409a99cf0744945d380db858a5e, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 41571598336
    m_Localized: In the center of the universe, <p=2> there is a magic place in which...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48718692352
    m_Localized: You can taste the most exquisite and exotic savors in the galaxy!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56469766144
    m_Localized: <sh>Heeeeeeeeeeeeeeelp!!!</sh>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58717913088
    m_Localized: A little star suddenly appeared and crashed onto Chuchu's stand!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 60953477120
    m_Localized: Oi welcome!<p=5> You want some ice-cream?<p=5> What flavor?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 63247761408
    m_Localized: I'm not here to order!<p=5> My friends have been captured by Queen
      Lychee for her grand party!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65630126080
    m_Localized: <w>Oh<p=2>oh<p=2>oh<p=2>oh!<p=5></w> These tiny plushies will be
      the centerpiece to make my party so stellar!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520832
    m_Localized: Please,<p=2> help us,<p=2> stellanaut Chuchu!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520833
    m_Localized: These words were enough to lighten the little jelly's heart!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520834
    m_Localized: You can count on me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520835
    m_Localized: <w>GROAN</w>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520836
    m_Localized: Hum...<p=5> First things first,<p=2> a little meal,<p=2> hehe...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55575863640064
    m_Localized: <p=5>.<p=5>.<p=5>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520838
    m_Localized: After saving the Star Spirits from Bubble Beach, <p=2>Chuchu is
      heading to Honey Hoop Galaxy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520839
    m_Localized: In the comfy bee kingdom, <p=2>she meets the queen Api-Api.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520840
    m_Localized: Hey,<p=2> welome to my eden, <p=2>little jelly.<p=5> Make yourself
      at home.<p=5>That's our moto here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520841
    m_Localized: Excuse me,<p=2> I'm looking for a Star Spirit who might be in your
      hive.<p=5> Does that ring any bell?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520842
    m_Localized: Does that have anything to do with honey?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520843
    m_Localized: Er...<p=5> no?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520844
    m_Localized: Then it doesn't interest us.<p=5> Go out,<p=2> shoo. <p=5>It's time
      for my ninth snack break.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520845
    m_Localized: (and I thought I was a glutton...)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6611818790912
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520846
    m_Localized: Haaaa...<p=5> Being a queen is the life...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520847
    m_Localized: Nothing can disturb my most serene moony bubble bath...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520848
    m_Localized: <sh>YOUR MAJESTY!!!</sh>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520849
    m_Localized: What now,<p=2> Lubin?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520850
    m_Localized: This is terrible!<p=5> Chuchu is already roaming somewhere on the
      Moon!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520851
    m_Localized: <sh>What did you say?!</sh>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520852
    m_Localized: What do we do now?<p=5> Should we cancel the party?...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520853
    m_Localized: Hmpf,<p=2> this is out of the question.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520854
    m_Localized: A chubby jelly like her will never be able to follow the rhythm
      of a moon queen!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520855
    m_Localized: <w>OHOHOHOHOHOHOH!</w>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520856
    m_Localized: Lychee,<p=2> stop being a baddie!<p=5> You're a coward!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520857
    m_Localized: We'll see who's the coward! <p=5>Your time has come! <p=5>Lubin!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520858
    m_Localized: Roger, <p=2>your most serene!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520859
    m_Localized: .<p=2>.<p=2>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520860
    m_Localized: Well then!<p=5> Where's the robot?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520861
    m_Localized: "Hum,<p=2> my liege...<p=5> There's no budget left for the robot,<p=2>
      the demo is over\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520862
    m_Localized: Ugh<p=2> it's been one of those days...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520863
    m_Localized: <w>Victory!</w>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520864
    m_Localized: Congratulations!<p=5> You went all the way to the end!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 683898018787328
    m_Localized: "Our stellanaut continues her search for other star spirits.<p=5>
      Here she is in the Han\u2019Bo mangrove forest."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 683898106867712
    m_Localized: Urgh...<p=5> I'm <w>starving</w>...<p=5> There must be something
      to snack on around here...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 683898106867713
    m_Localized: <sh>Cuicui on the rescue!</sh>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 683898106867714
    m_Localized: Here,<p=2> Chuchu!<p=5> I found these star bits not far from here!<p=5>
      You see?<p=5> I'm a great hero too!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 683898106867715
    m_Localized: Oh thanks,<p=2> Cuicui,<p=2> that's very nice of...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 683898106867716
    m_Localized: GULP
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 683898106867717
    m_Localized: .<p=2>.<p=2>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 683898106867718
    m_Localized: They won't get away with this...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 683898106867719
    m_Localized: <w>[CONNECTING TO HONEYHIVE KINGDOM]</w>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 683898106867720
    m_Localized: <w>Nyom<p=1> glurk<p=1> hmpf...</w><p=5> You're...<p=2> <w>nom...</w><p=2>
      bothering our snack...<p=2> <w>nyom nyom nyom</w>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 683898106867721
    m_Localized: My dear Api-Api,<p=2> I just came to make sure that the star spirits
      are still safely kept in your hive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 683898106867722
    m_Localized: Oh these tiny snacks?<p=5> Little jelly already freed some.<p=5>
      She'd make a nice servant.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 683898106867723
    m_Localized: <sh>WHAT?!<p=5> YOU HAD ONE JOB YOU BIG-</sh>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 683898106867724
    m_Localized: <sh>URGH...</sh>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 683898106867725
    m_Localized: We had both agreed that you would keep them here while I got ready
      for my grand party...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 683898106867726
    m_Localized: <w>Relax</w>,<p=2> snow white.<p=5> Right about now,<p=2> she must
      be getting her butt stung in our bramble forests.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 683898106867727
    m_Localized: .<p=2>.<p=2>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 683898106867728
    m_Localized: I'm not entirely convinced...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 683898106867729
    m_Localized: After saving the Star Spirits from the hive,<p=2> Chuchu is coming
      to the Moon!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 683898115256320
    m_Localized: Be careful,<p=2> I need to keep a low profile...<p=5> The bunnies
      seem to be on their guard...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 683898115256321
    m_Localized: <sh>HA!!!</sh>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 683898115256322
    m_Localized: .<p=2>.<p=2>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 683898115256323
    m_Localized: (good thing their brains are made of mochi.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 683898115256324
    m_Localized: I'm coming, Lychee!<p=5> I'll set these poor, imprisoned star spirits
      free for your evil party!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2503254537203712
    m_Localized: Chuchu starts her adventure in Bubble Beach Galaxy!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2503254583341056
    m_Localized: The moon bunnies have captured another Star Spirit!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2503254583341057
    m_Localized: <sh>Save me!!!</sh>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2503254583341058
    m_Localized: Let her go!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2503254583341059
    m_Localized: I'm gonna...<p=5> huff...<p=5> free her...<p=5> right now...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2503254583341060
    m_Localized: .<p=2>.<p=2>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2503254583341061
    m_Localized: Ugh,<p=2> I should've brought a snack...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2503254583341062
    m_Localized: Oh!<p=5> Star Bits!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2503254583341063
    m_Localized: They're so tasty and spakly! I'm gonna stuff myself silly with these!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2503254583341064
    m_Localized: Hey uh...<p=5> don't forget about me,<p=2> okay?...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
